---
args: { criteria: ScoringCriteriaSet, alternatives: ValidMethodInventory }
returns: RubricSpec[]
---
Place every score boundary at a named evidence difference: correct setup with arithmetic error, incomplete proof, unsupported leap, or complete alternative method. Ensure equal evidence earns equal credit across methods. Give each rubric a version identifier and keep unresolved alternatives marked for semantic review rather than assigning them zero.
